ecuwk@warwick.ac.uk (Huggybear) writes:

> I know what you need to do the game, but how the hell do you complete the
>sodding thing? I'm not interested in answers which involve polypiling...

One suggestion I would make is that you try playing a Valkyrie (if you
don't already). Good armor, high hit points and Excalibur early on.
Probably the easiest to play.

You say that you often die from misfortunes. If after a few wishes you
have an artifact and excellent armor I might suggest that you forget
about wishing for some of the more esoteric things and wish for a couple
of amulets of life saving. They are the only protection from misfortunes.
(Also, stop off on your way up in Vlad's Tower, there is another one in
there).

